  "details": "Jivejdon through 5.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability in SubscriptionServiceImp.deleteSubscription that allows authenticated users to delete other users' subscriptions by ID. Attackers can submit a delete action to /account/protected/sub/subSaveAction with another user's subscriptionId to remove their thread, forum, tag or account subscriptions.",
